; `optional=false` / `omit=optional` (the previous contents of this file) make wrangler
; unusable: workerd ships its binary in the platform-specific optional dependency
; `@cloudflare/workerd-windows-64` / `-linux-x64` / `-darwin-*`, and without it every
; wrangler command dies with
;   Error: The package "@cloudflare/workerd-windows-64" could not be found, and is needed by workerd.
; Verified broken on Windows with npm 11: `npx wrangler whoami` / `deploy` both fail until
; optional dependencies are installed. Keep optional dependencies ENABLED here.
include=optional
